    "Are You Sure?": "Apakah Anda Yakin?",
    "This action can not be undone. Do you want to continue?": "Tindakan ini tidak dapat dibatalkan. Apakah Anda ingin melanjutkan?",
    "Account is an account management software that facilitates ease in revenue calculation by keeping a tab on all the accountancy matters of business. Based on Laravel, this accountancy software will make your business operations smooth and convenient. A graphical and tabular representation of various elements will help you make informed decisions for your firm.": "Modul Akuntansi memudahkan pencatatan keuangan, pengelolaan pendapatan, pengeluaran, bagan akun, dan pembuatan laporan keuangan secara komprehensif.",
    "ACCOUNTING": "AKUNTANSI",
    "BILLING, SIMPLIFIED": "PENAGIHAN LEBIH MUDAH",
    "Accounting gives you the power to keep an eye on all accounting and inventory matters from one tab. You’ll never have to manage accounting with one tool, and control inventory with another - ever again!": "Akuntansi memberi Anda kemudahan mengontrol semua urusan keuangan dan inventaris dari satu tempat terpadu.",
    "Account Helps You Simplify Your Accounting and Billing": "Akuntansi Membantu Menyederhanakan Pembukuan dan Penagihan Anda",
    "Simplify Your Accounting and Billing": "Sederhanakan Pembukuan dan Penagihan Anda",
    "Simplify your accounting and make it easy to keep an eye on your money. Set financial goals and let the system monitor them for you, automate taxes, and more! - without lifting a finger.": "Sederhanakan akuntansi Anda dan pantau arus kas masuk dan keluar secara real-time.",
    "Take Control Of Your Inventory": "Kendalikan Inventaris Anda",
    "Save time by managing your entire inventory with a few clicks. Easily create categories and add products to them. Modify product prices whenever you want, assign SKUs, create different tax rates, and do so much more!": "Hemat waktu dengan mengelola seluruh inventaris dalam beberapa klik.",
    "Take Your Project from Proposal to Payment": "Bawa Proyek Anda dari Proposal Hingga Pembayaran",
    "Land new clients in a flash, and get paid just as fast. Create proposal templates and pitch your future clients. Turn your accepted proposals into payable invoices, send reminders, and get paid fast - all in one place!": "Ubah proposal yang disetujui menjadi faktur tagihan dan terima pembayaran dengan cepat.",
    "Get All the Critical Tools to Manage Business Finances": "Dapatkan Semua Alat Penting untuk Mengelola Keuangan Bisnis",
    "Manage Accounting Quickly and Easily": "Kelola Akuntansi dengan Cepat dan Mudah",
    "Manage your billing and accounting without little to no effort! Set financial goals and let the system monitor them for you, automate taxes, and more! - without lifting a finger.": "Kelola penagihan dan pembukuan dengan efisien dan otomatis.",
    "Handle Inventory Tasks Without Stress": "Kelola Tugas Inventaris Tanpa Beban",
    "Easily manage inventory by creating categories and adding products to them. Modify product prices whenever you want, assign SKUs, create different tax rates, and do so much more!": "Kelola inventaris, kategori, harga, SKU, dan tarif pajak dengan mudah.",
    "Take Your Project From Proposal To Payment": "Bawa Proyek Anda Dari Proposal Ke Pembayaran",
    "Create proposal templates and pitch your future clients. Turn your accepted proposals into payable invoices, send reminders, and get paid fast - all in one place!": "Buat template proposal, ubah menjadi faktur, dan terima pembayaran tepat waktu.",
    "Reports": "Laporan",
    "Get a report on transactions with an easy filtering option. Download the required account statements in either PDF, CSV, or Excel format. You get duly prepared reports on individual Income, Expenses, Tax, Invoice, and bill summary. Filter them based on Account, category, and customers. Also, a graphical display of the Income VS Expense chart along with a detailed calculation of Profit and Loss will help you make informed decisions. Filter the tax summary and Income VS Expense chart based on financial years.": "Dapatkan laporan transaksi lengkap dengan opsi filter dan unduhan format PDF, CSV, atau Excel.",
    "Budget Planner": "Perencana Anggaran (Budget Planner)",
    "A budget is a financial plan for a specified period to keep in check with the working capital. This feature here helps to maintain the capital flow. You can set monthly, quarterly, half-yearly, or yearly budgets according to your business plans and needs. The main categories are “Income” and “Expense” where one can edit /update /delete the sub-categories as well.": "Tetapkan anggaran bulanan, kuartalan, atau tahunan untuk menjaga arus kas dan modal kerja bisnis Anda.",
